OL,3,GNEWSACharities face growing financial
OL,4,Apressures
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If we don't have enough money, we will
OL,7,Fnot [be] opening our doors after 4
OL,8,FSeptember. Our doors will be shut and
OL,9,Fthat will be devastating".
OL,11,FA charity that has been running for 38
OL,12,Fyears is on the verge of closure due to
OL,13,Ffinancial strains including a decline
OL,14,Fin membership, donations and funding.
OL,16,FDebs Heffernan, centre care manager at
OL,17,FAge Concern Twyford, said that the
OL,18,Fcharity has been struggling for the
OL,19,Flast eight months and that they have
OL,20,F"hit our reserves, we are in the red
OL,21,Fand we are not financially stable
OL,22,Fenough to keep this going".
